# Meta Muse remote rule set for Loon
#
# This file routes the local Muse client, its Meta AI transport, the current
# account handoff, and first-party assets used by the public web client.
# The Muse Secure VM runs in Meta's cloud; its own browser egress is not
# controlled by Loon on the user's device.

# Muse client, authentication service, and Meta AI transport.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN,auth.meta.com

# Current Meta account handoff observed from muse.ai.
DOMAIN,www.facebook.com
DOMAIN,www.instagram.com

# First-party scripts, media, embedded artifacts, and app resources used by
# the current public Muse web client.
DOMAIN,connect.facebook.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdninstagram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ecto1usercontent.com
DOMAIN,meta-agents-apps.workers.dev
